// # Ultra-Low Latency ITCH/OUCH 5.0 and L3 Order Book Facade
//
// Logline: Unified entry point re-exporting NASDAQ ITCH/OUCH 5.0 parsers, L3 order matching, DMA pre-trade risk, and market depth engines.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 companion high-frequency exchange feed and direct market access submodules.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import ITCH 5.0 feeds, OUCH 5.0 order entry, DMA pre-trade risk, and L3 matching engines.
//   2. Re-export typed public helper markers, default risk configurations, and book builders.
//   3. Maintain unified entry points for openOODA Ultra-Low Latency Fintech and DMA consumers.

